          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Caster gains the ability to make claw attacks as a lion. He may attack using the Claw Attack Table (from Arms Law), with a maximum of Medium results. The caster must develop skill (i.e., an OB) with these claws (cost to develop is the same as Martial Arts Striking; stat modifiers are St/St/Ag)."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "12. Insect Sense",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
